<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-003" chapter-id="c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes" source-id="s-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes-ws2401780">
  <p id="c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">夏四月乙巳，皇太子<persName id="c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p001:m0009" ref="0va_s3x_wb4">統</persName>薨。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p002" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">六月丁未，以前太子詹事<persName id="c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p002:m0011" ref="asf_oz2_jik">蕭淵猷</persName>爲中護軍。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p003" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">癸丑，立昭明太子子南徐州刺史華容公<persName id="c-liangshu-003-xiewei-princes:p003:m0017" ref="yqs_lxt_73d">歡</persName>爲豫章郡王</p>
</text>
